          <span class="font-bold text-xl text-white">CloudDroid</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm max-w-md mb-6">
          Enterprise-grade cloud Android workspaces for QA automation, app testing, and secure remote productivity.
        </p>
         <div class="text-sm text-slate-400 space-y-1">
           <p>CloudDroid</p>
           <p>RUNESTONE HANDLUNG s.r.o.</p>
           <p>Soukenická 877/9</p>
           <p>Ostrava, 702 00</p>
           <p>Czech Republic</p>
           <p>IČO: 23389702</p>
           <p>support@clouddroid.eu</p>
